# w4_positions_1.lj4s - W4 acceptance, restart persistence (docs/w4-integration.md, Acceptance): opens every W4 window that
# persists (DFM Position poDesigned / poDefaultPosOnly, lj_formsini_section; the code-built help viewer is poScreenCenter, centred each time), moves it,
# closes it; quit writes forms.ini. Run w4_positions_2.lj4s after it, in the same library (U:W4Entry after
# w4_entry_points.lj4s: fixtures 1-7 patched). Positions on the acceptance PC's second display (y >= 1440), as W2 / W3.

open cue_stack
wait 200
move cue_stack 100 1600
wait 200
close cue_stack
open da2532
wait 200
move da2532 140 1620
wait 200
close da2532
open dmx_in
wait 200
move dmx_in 180 1640
wait 200
close dmx_in
open dmxin_translation
wait 200
move dmxin_translation 220 1660
wait 200
close dmxin_translation
open find_profile
wait 200
move find_profile 260 1680
wait 200
close find_profile
open fingers
wait 200
move fingers 300 1700
wait 200
close fingers
open fingers_status
wait 200
move fingers_status 340 1720
wait 200
close fingers_status
open fingers_functions
wait 200
move fingers_functions 380 1740
wait 200
close fingers_functions
open fingers_jog_functions
wait 200
move fingers_jog_functions 420 1760
wait 200
close fingers_jog_functions
open fingers_page_functions
wait 200
move fingers_page_functions 460 1780
wait 200
close fingers_page_functions
open fingers_slot_functions
wait 200
move fingers_slot_functions 500 1800
wait 200
close fingers_slot_functions
open fingers_ud_functions
wait 200
move fingers_ud_functions 540 1820
wait 200
close fingers_ud_functions
open hidden_fixture
